      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm working on some morphological parsing for a dataset of agglutinative words in a Finno-Ugric dialect. Could you help me identify the constituent morphemes (roots, derivational suffixes, and inflectional endings) for the following forms? I'm also interested in any morphophonemic changes like vowel harmony or consonant gradation that occur at the morpheme boundaries.\n\nWords:\n1. *talossanikin\n2. *kirjoitustasi\n3. *metsänkylän",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
